  "body": [
    "Your commitment to Fairtrade sourcing is impactful, and we want you to make the most of it!",
    "You are part of a global community of companies operating with people and planet in mind. We are here to support you on your Fairtrade journey. This page serves as your hub for the essentials, whether that’s marketing your Fairtrade products, reporting Fairtrade sales or getting support with your supply chain.",
    "Contact your Account Manager directly for support.",
    "75% of shoppers globally recognize the Fairtrade Mark",
    "76% of US shoppers say that the Fairtrade label makes it easy to find ethically and responsibly produced items",
    "You can see it in the way shoppers are stepping up, voicing their opinions and changing their purchasing habits-today's shoppers care about what’s in their food and where it’s from. With rigorous standards, 30+ years of experience and the impact to show for it, Fairtrade is one way you’re answering this demand. We're here to help you show it off.",
    "Your Fairtrade partnership goes beyond certification. Flip through to explore additional perks and opportunities available to our partners.",
    "Through Fairtrade America, partners gain exclusive access to ASBN's network of 200,000+ purpose-driven business leaders.",
    "As an official 1% for the Planet partner, your Fairtrade licensing fees count toward your commitment.",
    "I need quick content for one of our digital channels. Where do I find that? I need quick content for one of our digital channels. Where do I find that? First check out our resource hub above for toolkits, photos and framework guidance. Our Marketing the Movement page provides examples of how to put these into practice. Then head over to Impact Stories and our Instagram for inspiration or commodity pages for quick stats.",
    "I want to get more products certified. Who should I talk to? I want to get more products certified. Who should I talk to? Amazing! Please reach out to license@fairtradeamerica.org.",
    "I am working on updating our packaging with the Fairtrade Mark. How do I do that? I am working on updating our packaging with the Fairtrade Mark. How do I do that? You can submit your updated artwork and recipes for review through our digital portal—Connect. Visit the Mark Guidelines as a refresher as well. For any questions, please reach out to your account manager."
  ],
